[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a function that can be used to toggle the column visibility. This function can be used to bind to an event handler to a checkbox."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"table-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Table Options"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"oncolumnvisibilitychange","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onColumnVisibilityChange"}]},{"type":"code","value":"onColumnVisibilityChange?: OnChangeFn<VisibilityState>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If provided, this function will be called with an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"updaterFn"},{"type":"text","value":" when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state.columnVisibility"},{"type":"text","value":" changes. This overrides the default internal state management, so you will need to persist the state change either fully or partially outside of the table."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"enablehiding-2","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enableHiding"}]},{"type":"code","value":"enableHiding?: boolean","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enables/disables hiding of columns."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"table-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Table API"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getvisibleflatcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getVisibleFlatColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getVisibleFlatColumns: () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a flat array of columns that are visible, including parent columns."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getvisibleleafcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getVisibleLeafColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getleftvisibleleafcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getLeftVisibleLeafColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getLeftVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the left portion of the table."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getrightvisibleleafcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getRightVisibleLeafColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getRightVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the right portion of the table."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getcentervisibleleafcolumns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getCenterVisibleLeafColumns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getCenterVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the unpinned/center portion of the table."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"setcolumnvisibility","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setColumnVisibility"}]},{"type":"code","value":"setColumnVisibility: (updater: Updater<VisibilityState>) => void","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Updates the column visibility state via an updater function or value"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"resetcolumnvisibility","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resetColumnVisibility"}]},{"type":"code","value":"resetColumnVisibility: (defaultState?: boolean) => void","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resets the column visibility state to the initial state. If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultState"},{"type":"text","value":" is provided, the state will be reset to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toggleallcolumnsvisible","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toggleAllColumnsVisible"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toggleAllColumnsVisible: (value?: boolean) => void","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Toggles the visibility of all columns"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getisallcolumnsvisible","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getIsAllColumnsVisible"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getIsAllColumnsVisible: () => boolean","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns whether all columns are visible"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getissomecolumnsvisible","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getIsSomeColumnsVisible"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getIsSomeColumnsVisible: () => boolean","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns whether some columns are visible"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"gettoggleallcolumnsvisibilityhandler","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler: () => ((event: unknown) => void)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a handler for toggling the visibility of all columns, meant to be bound to a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"input[type=checkbox]"},{"type":"text","value":" element."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"row-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row API"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getvisiblecells","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getVisibleCells"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getVisibleCells: () => Cell<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns an array of cells that account for column visibility for the row."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"state","text":"State","level":2},{"id":"column-def-options","text":"Column Def Options","level":2},{"id":"enablehiding","text":"enableHiding","level":3},{"id":"column-api","text":"Column API","level":2},{"id":"getcanhide","text":"getCanHide","level":3},{"id":"getisvisible","text":"getIsVisible","level":3},{"id":"togglevisibility","text":"toggleVisibility","level":3},{"id":"gettogglevisibilityhandler","text":"getToggleVisibilityHandler","level":3},{"id":"table-options","text":"Table Options","level":2},{"id":"oncolumnvisibilitychange","text":"onColumnVisibilityChange","level":3},{"id":"enablehiding-2","text":"enableHiding","level":3},{"id":"table-api","text":"Table API","level":2},{"id":"getvisibleflatcolumns","text":"getVisibleFlatColumns","level":3},{"id":"getvisibleleafcolumns","text":"getVisibleLeafColumns","level":3},{"id":"getleftvisibleleafcolumns","text":"getLeftVisibleLeafColumns","level":3},{"id":"getrightvisibleleafcolumns","text":"getRightVisibleLeafColumns","level":3},{"id":"getcentervisibleleafcolumns","text":"getCenterVisibleLeafColumns","level":3},{"id":"setcolumnvisibility","text":"setColumnVisibility","level":3},{"id":"resetcolumnvisibility","text":"resetColumnVisibility","level":3},{"id":"toggleallcolumnsvisible","text":"toggleAllColumnsVisible","level":3},{"id":"getisallcolumnsvisible","text":"getIsAllColumnsVisible","level":3},{"id":"getissomecolumnsvisible","text":"getIsSomeColumnsVisible","level":3},{"id":"gettoggleallcolumnsvisibilityhandler","text":"getToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler","level":3},{"id":"row-api","text":"Row API","level":2},{"id":"getvisiblecells","text":"getVisibleCells","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## State\n\nColumn visibility state is stored on the table using the following shape:\n\n```tsx\nexport type VisibilityState = Record<string, boolean>\n\nexport type VisibilityTableState = {\n  columnVisibility: VisibilityState\n}\n```\n\n## Column Def Options\n\n### `enableHiding`\n\n```tsx\nenableHiding?: boolean\n```\n\nEnables/disables hiding the column\n\n## Column API\n\n### `getCanHide`\n\n```tsx\ngetCanHide: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether the column can be hidden\n\n### `getIsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether the column is visible\n\n### `toggleVisibility`\n\n```tsx\ntoggleVisibility: (value?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nToggles the column visibility\n\n### `getToggleVisibilityHandler`\n\n```tsx\ngetToggleVisibilityHandler: () => (event: unknown) => void\n```\n\nReturns a function that can be used to toggle the column visibility. This function can be used to bind to an event handler to a checkbox.\n\n## Table Options\n\n### `onColumnVisibilityChange`\n\n```tsx\nonColumnVisibilityChange?: OnChangeFn<VisibilityState>\n```\n\nIf provided, this function will be called with an `updaterFn` when `state.columnVisibility` changes. This overrides the default internal state management, so you will need to persist the state change either fully or partially outside of the table.\n\n### `enableHiding`\n\n```tsx\nenableHiding?: boolean\n```\n\nEnables/disables hiding of columns.\n\n## Table API\n\n### `getVisibleFlatColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleFlatColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns a flat array of columns that are visible, including parent columns.\n\n### `getVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible.\n\n### `getLeftVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetLeftVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the left portion of the table.\n\n### `getRightVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetRightVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the right portion of the table.\n\n### `getCenterVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetCenterVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the unpinned/center portion of the table.\n\n### `setColumnVisibility`\n\n```tsx\nsetColumnVisibility: (updater: Updater<VisibilityState>) => void\n```\n\nUpdates the column visibility state via an updater function or value\n\n### `resetColumnVisibility`\n\n```tsx\nresetColumnVisibility: (defaultState?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nResets the column visibility state to the initial state. If `defaultState` is provided, the state will be reset to `{}`\n\n### `toggleAllColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ntoggleAllColumnsVisible: (value?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nToggles the visibility of all columns\n\n### `getIsAllColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsAllColumnsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether all columns are visible\n\n### `getIsSomeColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsSomeColumnsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether some columns are visible\n\n### `getToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler`\n\n```tsx\ngetToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler: () => ((event: unknown) => void)\n```\n\nReturns a handler for toggling the visibility of all columns, meant to be bound to a `input[type=checkbox]` element.\n\n## Row API\n\n### `getVisibleCells`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleCells: () => Cell<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns an array of cells that account for column visibility for the row.","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Column Visibility APIs\nid: column-visibility\n---\n\n## State\n\nColumn visibility state is stored on the table using the following shape:\n\n```tsx\nexport type VisibilityState = Record<string, boolean>\n\nexport type VisibilityTableState = {\n  columnVisibility: VisibilityState\n}\n```\n\n## Column Def Options\n\n### `enableHiding`\n\n```tsx\nenableHiding?: boolean\n```\n\nEnables/disables hiding the column\n\n## Column API\n\n### `getCanHide`\n\n```tsx\ngetCanHide: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether the column can be hidden\n\n### `getIsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether the column is visible\n\n### `toggleVisibility`\n\n```tsx\ntoggleVisibility: (value?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nToggles the column visibility\n\n### `getToggleVisibilityHandler`\n\n```tsx\ngetToggleVisibilityHandler: () => (event: unknown) => void\n```\n\nReturns a function that can be used to toggle the column visibility. This function can be used to bind to an event handler to a checkbox.\n\n## Table Options\n\n### `onColumnVisibilityChange`\n\n```tsx\nonColumnVisibilityChange?: OnChangeFn<VisibilityState>\n```\n\nIf provided, this function will be called with an `updaterFn` when `state.columnVisibility` changes. This overrides the default internal state management, so you will need to persist the state change either fully or partially outside of the table.\n\n### `enableHiding`\n\n```tsx\nenableHiding?: boolean\n```\n\nEnables/disables hiding of columns.\n\n## Table API\n\n### `getVisibleFlatColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleFlatColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns a flat array of columns that are visible, including parent columns.\n\n### `getVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible.\n\n### `getLeftVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetLeftVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the left portion of the table.\n\n### `getRightVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetRightVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the right portion of the table.\n\n### `getCenterVisibleLeafColumns`\n\n```tsx\ngetCenterVisibleLeafColumns: () => Column<TData>[]\n```\n\nIf column pinning, returns a flat array of leaf-node columns that are visible in the unpinned/center portion of the table.\n\n### `setColumnVisibility`\n\n```tsx\nsetColumnVisibility: (updater: Updater<VisibilityState>) => void\n```\n\nUpdates the column visibility state via an updater function or value\n\n### `resetColumnVisibility`\n\n```tsx\nresetColumnVisibility: (defaultState?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nResets the column visibility state to the initial state. If `defaultState` is provided, the state will be reset to `{}`\n\n### `toggleAllColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ntoggleAllColumnsVisible: (value?: boolean) => void\n```\n\nToggles the visibility of all columns\n\n### `getIsAllColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsAllColumnsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether all columns are visible\n\n### `getIsSomeColumnsVisible`\n\n```tsx\ngetIsSomeColumnsVisible: () => boolean\n```\n\nReturns whether some columns are visible\n\n### `getToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler`\n\n```tsx\ngetToggleAllColumnsVisibilityHandler: () => ((event: unknown) => void)\n```\n\nReturns a handler for toggling the visibility of all columns, meant to be bound to a `input[type=checkbox]` element.\n\n## Row API\n\n### `getVisibleCells`\n\n```tsx\ngetVisibleCells: () => Cell<TData>[]\n```\n\nReturns an array of cells that account for column visibility for the row."}
